msgid "Drives loader forward, shattering glass clusters in its path.<br><ui-color 504><ui-edge-color 505>Additional Effect: </ui-edge-color></ui-color>Accrues a unit of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Energy Load</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, up to a maximum of 6"
